# What a `composer require` downloads.
#
# Composer fetches the dist archive, which is `git archive` — so without this
# file every user of the package pulls the test fixtures too: 63 MB of signed
# images against 500 kB of source (measured, step 62). The fixtures are the
# drift alarms; they belong in the repository and not in a consumer's
# vendor/ directory.
#
# What still ships, on purpose: src/, bin/, docs/, specs/, notes/ and
# AI-LOG.md. They are what the README links to, and a package that describes
# how it was built and where it differs from c2patool should carry that with
# it. Together they are under 2 MB.
#
# Except the fixture builders, bin/make-*.php and the helpers they share
# (SPEC-023 amendment 2, step 209): each one reads tests/Fixtures/, which
# does not ship, so in a consumer's vendor/ it cannot run. They were half a
# megabyte of the dist.

/tests          export-ignore
/.github        export-ignore
/tools          export-ignore
/.gitattributes export-ignore
/.gitignore     export-ignore
/phpunit.xml    export-ignore
/phpstan.neon   export-ignore
/pint.json      export-ignore
/deptrac.yaml   export-ignore
/bin/make-*.php          export-ignore
/bin/variant-helpers.php export-ignore
